<title>UK: Portugal sets 10 bln yen dual-currency bond.</title>
<headline>Portugal sets 10 bln yen dual-currency bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Citibank International Plc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   REPUBLIC OF PORTUGAL</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    24.JUN.99</p>
<p> TYPE   DUAL-CURRENCY ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    24.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.825     PAY FREQ   SEMI-ANN  SALE LIMITS UK/JP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA-   DENOMS (K) 500</p>
<p> NOTES	REDEMPTION PAYABLE IN US DOLLARS $4,312.57 PER</p>
<p>		500,000 YEN. ISSUED OFF GLOBAL MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
